---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accueil · NESDZ"
  description="NESDZ : briefing vol, terrains proches, docs officiels, annuaire ULM et culture de vol."
>
  <section class="hero home-restore-hero">
    <div class="container home-hero-grid">
      <article class="card hero-card home-main-card">
        <div class="meta">
          <a class="pill" href="/outils/">Briefing vol</a>
          <a class="pill" href="/modeles/">Annuaire ULM</a>
          <a class="pill" href="/journal/">Journal</a>
          <a class="pill" href="/tags/securite/">Sécurité</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-hero-kicker">Briefing vol · terrains proches · docs officiels</div>

        <h1>
          Le briefing vol pour<br />
          lire vite, décider juste,<br />
          garder de la marge.
        </h1>

        <p class="lead">
          NESDZ réunit un briefing terrain simple à ouvrir, des repères météo lisibles,
          des terrains proches et des documents officiels utiles pour préparer un départ
          ou vérifier une option sans perdre du temps.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn home-btn-primary" href="/outils/">Lancer le briefing</a>
          <a class="btn home-btn-secondary" href="/modeles/">Explorer l’annuaire ULM</a>
        </div>

        <p class="home-hero-note">
          Le journal et l’annuaire restent là pour approfondir après la première lecture.
          Avant le vol, l’entrée utile reste le briefing.
        </p>

        <hr class="sep" />

        <div class="home-featured-panel home-briefing-panel">
          <div class="row home-featured-top" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <div class="row" style="gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <span class="badge">Service principal</span>
              <span class="pill">/outils/</span>
            </div>
            <span class="pill">Lecture rapide</span>
          </div>

          <p class="home-briefing-intro">
            Dans <strong>/outils/</strong>, l’essentiel est regroupé sur une seule page :
            météo terrain, alternatives proches, documents officiels locaux quand ils existent
            et accès direct aux NOTAM officiels.
          </p>

          <div class="home-briefing-grid">
            <div class="home-briefing-item">
              <div class="home-briefing-label">Lecture météo</div>
              <p>METAR, TAF et lecture rapide pour décider sans fouiller.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="home-briefing-item">
              <div class="home-briefing-label">Navigation locale</div>
              <p>Terrains proches pour alternatives, déroutement et vision locale.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="home-briefing-item">
              <div class="home-briefing-label">Docs officiels</div>
              <p>VAC et AIP AD locales quand la ressource est déjà disponible sur le site.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="home-briefing-item">
              <div class="home-briefing-label">NOTAM officiels</div>
              <p>Accès clair vers SOFIA-Briefing, sans faux résumé réglementaire maison.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="actions home-briefing-actions">
            <a class="btn home-btn-primary" href="/outils/">Lancer le briefing</a>
            <a class="btn home-btn-secondary" href="/journal/">Lire le journal</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <aside class="hero-aside home-side-stack">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="pad">
            <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
              <h2 style="margin:0;">Derniers articles</h2>
              <span class="pill">5</span>
            </div>

            <ul class="home-article-list">
              <li class="home-article-item">
                <a class="home-article-link" href="/journal/2026-01-edito-nesdz/">
                  <div class="home-article-meta">
                    <span class="home-article-highlight">Mis à jour</span>
                    <time datetime="2026-02-27T00:00:00.000Z">27 févr. 2026</time>
                  </div>
                  <h3>L’Esprit ULM : Manifeste pour un ciel libre et responsable</h3>
                  <p>
                    Pour le lancement de ce nouveau journal, nous explorons ce qui définit
                    l’essence profonde de l’aviation ultralégère.
                  </p>
                </a>
              </li>

              <li class="home-article-item">
                <a class="home-article-link" href="/journal/2026-02-choisir-ulm/">
                  <div class="home-article-meta">
                    <time datetime="2026-02-02T00:00:00.000Z">2 févr. 2026</time>
                  </div>
                  <h3>Choisir son ULM : une méthode simple (et anti-auto-mensonge)</h3>
                  <p>
                    Avant de regarder les photos, regarde ton usage : terrain, météo,
                    budget, maintenance et objectifs réels.
                  </p>
                </a>
              </li>

              <li class="home-article-item">
                <a class="home-article-link" href="/journal/2025-12-metrologie-du-vent/">
                  <div class="home-article-meta">
                    <time datetime="2025-12-14T00:00:00.000Z">14 déc. 2025</time>
                  </div>
                  <h3>Lire le vent comme un pilote (pas comme une appli)</h3>
                  <p>
                    Comprendre les indices du terrain pour décider vite, calmement
                    et sans illusion dangereuse.
                  </p>
                </a>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-model-section" style="padding: 8px 0 18px;">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="pad">
            <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <h2 style="margin:0;">Modèles en vedette</h2>
              <span class="pill">4</span>
            </div>

            <p class="home-section-intro">
              Quelques fiches utiles pour comparer des machines déjà enrichies, sans reprendre toute la recherche à zéro.
            </p>

            <div class="home-model-list">
              <article class="home-model-item">
                <a
                  class="home-model-link"
                  href="/modeles/aeroprakt-a-22-foxbat/"
                  aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aeroprakt A-22 (Foxbat)"
                ></a>

                <div class="home-model-content">
                  <div class="home-model-head">
                    <div class="home-model-text">
                      <div class="t">Aeroprakt A-22 (Foxbat)</div>
                      <div class="s">
                        Aeroprakt · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 UL / 912 ULS ·
                        Croisière ~150 km/h
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="home-model-status">
                      <span
                        class="pill"
                        aria-label="Statut éditorial : fiche enrichie"
                        title="Statut éditorial : fiche enrichie"
                      >
                        Enrichie
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="home-model-meta">
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/stol/" title="Tag : stol">stol</a>
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/ecole/" title="Tag : ecole">ecole</a>
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/aluminium/" title="Tag : aluminium">aluminium</a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="home-model-item">
                <a
                  class="home-model-link"
                  href="/modeles/aeroprakt-a-32-vixxen/"
                  aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen"
                ></a>

                <div class="home-model-content">
                  <div class="home-model-head">
                    <div class="home-model-text">
                      <div class="t">Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen</div>
                      <div class="s">
                        Aeroprakt · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 ULS · Croisière ~175 km/h
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="home-model-status">
                      <span
                        class="pill"
                        aria-label="Statut éditorial : fiche enrichie"
                        title="Statut éditorial : fiche enrichie"
                      >
                        Enrichie
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="home-model-meta">
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/voyage/" title="Tag : voyage">voyage</a>
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/rapide/" title="Tag : rapide">rapide</a>
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/aluminium/" title="Tag : aluminium">aluminium</a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="home-model-item">
                <a
                  class="home-model-link"
                  href="/modeles/aerospool-wt9-dynamic/"
                  aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aerospool WT9 Dynamic"
                ></a>

                <div class="home-model-content">
                  <div class="home-model-head">
                    <div class="home-model-text">
                      <div class="t">Aerospool WT9 Dynamic</div>
                      <div class="s">
                        Aerospool · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 ULS
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="home-model-status">
                      <span
                        class="pill"
                        aria-label="Statut éditorial : fiche enrichie"
                        title="Statut éditorial : fiche enrichie"
                      >
                        Enrichie
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="home-model-meta">
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/voyage/" title="Tag : voyage">voyage</a>
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/rapide/" title="Tag : rapide">rapide</a>
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/composite/" title="Tag : composite">composite</a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="home-model-item">
                <a
                  class="home-model-link"
                  href="/modeles/autogyro-cavalon/"
                  aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : AutoGyro Cavalon"
                ></a>

                <div class="home-model-content">
                  <div class="home-model-head">
                    <div class="home-model-text">
                      <div class="t">AutoGyro Cavalon</div>
                      <div class="s">
                        AutoGyro GmbH · Autogire · 2 places · Rotax 915 iS
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="home-model-status">
                      <span
                        class="pill"
                        aria-label="Statut éditorial : fiche enrichie"
                        title="Statut éditorial : fiche enrichie"
                      >
                        Enrichie
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="home-model-meta">
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/voyage/" title="Tag : voyage">voyage</a>
                    <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/composite/" title="Tag : composite">composite</a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container" style="padding: 8px 0 18px;">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="pad">
        <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <h2 style="margin:0;">Explorer par thèmes</h2>
          <span class="pill">9 entrées</span>
        </div>

        <p style="margin:8px 0 0; color:var(--muted);">
          Une porte d’entrée rapide vers les grands sujets du journal et les profils de machines de l’annuaire.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:14px;gap:14px;">
          <div class="card home-topic-card" style="box-shadow:none;">
            <div class="pad">
              <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <h3 style="margin:0;">Journal</h3>
                <span class="pill">3</span>
              </div>

              <p style="margin:8px 0 0; color:var(--muted);">
                Pilotage, sécurité, météo, navigation, essai, comparatif…
              </p>

              <div class="row" style="gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px;">
                <a class="pill" href="/tags/pilotage/" style="text-decoration:none;">pilotage · 1</a>
                <a class="pill" href="/tags/meteo/" style="text-decoration:none;">météo · 1</a>
                <a class="pill" href="/tags/securite/" style="text-decoration:none;">sécurité · 1</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card home-topic-card" style="box-shadow:none;">
            <div class="pad">
              <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <h3 style="margin:0;">Modèles ULM</h3>
                <span class="pill">6</span>
              </div>

              <p style="margin:8px 0 0; color:var(--muted);">
                Voyage, école, STOL, polyvalence, matériaux et profils d’usage.
              </p>

              <div class="row" style="gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px;">
                <a class="pill" href="/tags/voyage/" style="text-decoration:none;">voyage · 23</a>
                <a class="pill" href="/tags/ecole/" style="text-decoration:none;">école · 16</a>
                <a class="pill" href="/tags/polyvalent/" style="text-decoration:none;">polyvalent · 11</a>
                <a class="pill" href="/tags/composite/" style="text-decoration:none;">composite · 10</a>
                <a class="pill" href="/tags/aluminium/" style="text-decoration:none;">aluminium · 7</a>
                <a class="pill" href="/tags/stol/" style="text-decoration:none;">stol · 7</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container" style="padding: 8px 0 26px;">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="pad">
        <h2>La promesse NESDZ</h2>

        <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <div class="card home-promise-card" style="box-shadow:none;">
            <div class="pad">
              <h3>Clarté</h3>
              <p>Un briefing lisible, des fiches structurées et des sources accessibles rapidement.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card home-promise-card" style="box-shadow:none;">
            <div class="pad">
              <h3>Sécurité</h3>
              <p>Des contenus pensés pour aider à garder des marges et décider sans théâtre inutile.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card home-promise-card" style="box-shadow:none;">
            <div class="pad">
              <h3>Culture de vol</h3>
              <p>L’ULM reste une pratique de liberté, mais jamais sans méthode, lucidité et sens du terrain.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style is:global>
    .home-restore-hero {
      padding: 38px 0 22px;
    }

    .home-hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .home-hero-grid > * {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .home-hero-grid .hero-card,
    .home-hero-grid .hero-aside {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: none;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .home-main-card {
      padding: 24px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 0% 0%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.07), transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(900px 420px at 100% 10%, rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.08), transparent 42%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.045), rgba(255,255,255,.02));
    }

    .home-side-stack {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .home-hero-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.92);
    }

    .home-main-card h1 {
      max-width: 11ch;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .home-main-card .lead {
      max-width: 68ch;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      line-height: 1.72;
      color: rgba(231, 238, 247, 0.9);
    }

    .home-main-card .actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .home-btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(125,211,252,.22), rgba(125,211,252,.10));
      border-color: rgba(125,211,252,.35);
    }

    .home-btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.035);
    }

    .home-hero-note {
      margin: 16px 0 0;
      font-size: 0.93rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(167, 182, 201, 0.95);
      max-width: 62ch;
    }

    .home-featured-panel {
      padding-top: 6px;
    }

    .home-briefing-intro {
      margin: 2px 0 0;
      max-width: 70ch;
      line-height: 1.68;
      color: rgba(231, 238, 247, 0.88);
    }

    .home-featured-top {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .home-briefing-panel {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .home-briefing-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .home-briefing-item {
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    }

    .home-briefing-label {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.92);
    }

    .home-briefing-item p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .home-briefing-actions {
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .hero-cover {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
      border-radius: 18px;
      margin: 18px 0 20px;
      object-fit: cover;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
    }

    .home-article-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .home-article-item {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .home-article-link {
      display: block;
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 14px 15px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      transition:
        background-color 0.18s ease,
        border-color 0.18s ease,
        box-shadow 0.18s ease,
        transform 0.18s ease;
    }

    .home-article-link:hover,
    .home-article-link:focus-visible {
      background: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.16);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.10);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-article-link:hover h3,
    .home-article-link:focus-visible h3 {
      color: #8bdcff;
    }

    .home-article-meta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .home-article-highlight {
      color: #67d9ff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .home-article-link h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .home-article-link p {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      line-height: 1.62;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 4;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .home-model-list {
      margin-top: 12px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .home-model-item {
      position: relative;
      display: block;
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 14px;
      transition:
        background-color 0.18s ease,
        box-shadow 0.18s ease,
        transform 0.18s ease;
    }

    .home-model-item:hover,
    .home-model-item:focus-within {
      background: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.05);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.14);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .home-model-item:hover .home-model-text .t,
    .home-model-item:focus-within .home-model-text .t {
      color: #8bdcff;
    }

    .home-model-item:first-child {
      border-top: 0;
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .home-model-link {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 2;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .home-model-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .home-model-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .home-model-text {
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .home-model-text .t {
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .home-model-text .s {
      margin-top: 4px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .home-model-status {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
    }

    .home-model-meta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .home-model-tag {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-section-intro {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
      max-width: 72ch;
    }

    .home-model-section .home-model-list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .home-model-section .home-model-item {
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    }

    .home-model-section .home-model-item:first-child {
      padding-top: 16px;
    }

    .home-topic-card,
    .home-promise-card {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.035), rgba(255,255,255,.02)),
        rgba(12,18,25,.56);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    }

    @media (min-width: 1100px) {
      .home-hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.7fr) minmax(320px, 0.9fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .home-main-card h1 {
        max-width: none;
      }

      .home-briefing-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .home-model-section .home-model-list {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .home-model-head {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
